# =============================================================================
# fpwiki-content .gitignore
#
# This repo is populated by an automated rsync that whitelists specific file
# extensions, so most junk can't leak in via the publisher. The patterns below
# are a defense-in-depth net for the rare case that someone clones, tinkers
# locally, and pushes by hand against the no-PR rule (please don't).
# =============================================================================

# OS junk
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# Editor scratch
.idea
.vscode
.fleet
.history
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Misc local
*.bak
*.tmp
*.orig
*.log
tmp/
